From: =?UTF-8?q?Micha=C5=82=20=C5=BBygowski?= <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:20:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(rdv3): enable DRTM support

Add the DRTM platform hooks for RD-V3 (previously only FVP Base had
them):

- NS DRAM address map and region validation,
- complete DMA protection over the PCIe SMMUs,
- TPM features,
- errors and remediation through an SCMI
- system reset,
- Event Log,
- mmap and stack sizing.

With NRD_EL3_FTPM=1 the DRTM PCRs are reset and extended in the EL3 fTPM at
locality 4, and the measurements default to SHA-384 (MBOOT_TPM_HASH_ALG),
as DEN0113 R48000 requires when the TPM supports it.

Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
---
